r>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 fve-data-id=\"0ccb8133fdf4c01e8d21f870f6842250d98b91dbe5d95c21a9b0c27645910392\" fve-mdx-b64=\"IyMgQ29kZSBCbG9ja3M=\">Code Blocks</h2>\n<h3 fve-data-id=\"5467f83393edbc88e856069f7a16617b22d36f12e12693f08b9ca123de3993b3\" fve-mdx-b64=\"IyMjIEphdmFTY3JpcHQgd2l0aCBTeW50YXggSGlnaGxpZ2h0aW5n\">JavaScript with Syntax Highlighting</h3>\n<pre fve-data-id=\"f2b9f85f1b862f4678154ebcffe112fc2abfd388c6b8bf247772541f84347771\" fve-mdx-b64=\"\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">// Simple function with template literals\nconst processData = (data, options = {}) => {\n  const { \n    transform = (x) => x, \n    filter = () => true,\n    sort = (a, b) => a - b \n  } = options;\n  \n  return data\n    .filter(filter)\n    .map(transform)\n    .sort(sort);\n};\n\n// Usage with simple props\nconst result = processData(users, {\n  transform: (user) => ({\n    ...user,\n    fullName: `${user.firstName} ${user.lastName}`\n  }),\n  filter: (user) => user.active,\n  sort: (a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name)\n});\n</code></pre>\n<h3 fve-data-id=\"e96c6a47c55add79ca261baad5b0f6851056ec7b8c4b130931d52cb4519182ab\" fve-mdx-b64=\"IyMjIFR5cGVTY3JpcHQgd2l0aCBHZW5lcmljcw==\">TypeScript with Generics</h3>\n<pre fve-data-id=\"c064dfd11ab87eeb376af14ecfaa82f75bfe641f232566ca5d642b6f170001b5\" fve-mdx-b64=\"\"><code class=\"language-typescript\">interface ApiResponse&#x3C;T> {\n  data: T;\n  status: 'success' | 'error';\n  message?: string;\n}\n\nclass ApiClient&#x3C;T> {\n  constructor(private baseUrl: string) {}\n  \n  async fetch&#x3C;R = T>(endpoint: string): Promise&#x3C;ApiResponse&#x3C;R>> {\n    const response = await fetch(`${this.baseUrl}${endpoint}`);\n    return response.json();\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst userClient = new ApiClient&#x3C;User>('/api/users');\nconst users = await userClient.fetch&#x3C;User[]>('/list');\n</code></pre>\n<h3 fve-data-id=\"1cae100450e256b3ebc0b10981ca9a9a6960008438f8ff9add535f810ab84724\" fve-mdx-b64=\"IyMjIENTUyB3aXRoIEN1c3RvbSBQcm9wZXJ0aWVz\">CSS with Custom Properties</h3>\n<pre fve-data-id=\"c091b22143e7c89b1761d08c3b81e83b9719a85957432e646d44c76662056cb8\" fve-mdx-b64=\"\"><code class=\"language-css\">:root {\n  --primary-color: #007bff;\n  --secondary-color: #6c757d;\n  --success-color: #28a745;\n  --danger-color: #dc3545;\n}\n\n.simple-component {\n  --component-padding: 1rem;\n  --component-border-radius: 0.5rem;\n  \n  padding: var(--component-padding);\n  border-radius: var(--component-border-radius);\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    135deg,\n    var(--primary-color),\n    var(--secondary-color)\n  );\n  color: white;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.simple-component:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.3);\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h2 fve-data-id=\"70f8c328fb8838a912974e2d13423ef82502da8678bfd2c3e80ee41b8d40374b\" fve-mdx-b64=\"IyMgTWF0aCBFeHByZXNzaW9ucw==\">Math Expressions</h2>\n<h3 fve-data-id=\"cd0a84219c192dd5e1b289e91e02d08097f48d5d5a3e1c0647f34389918e2802\" fve-mdx-b64=\"IyMjIElubGluZSBNYXRo\">Inline Math</h3>\n<p fve-data-id=\"71e8172f3efff5b40b81a1f8b0269568f2bd589d25cfe957e43c413551ac928d\" fve-mdx-b64=\"VGhlIHF1YWRyYXRpYyBmb3JtdWxhIGlzOiAkeCA9IFxmcmFjey1iIFxwbSBcc3FydHtiXjIgLSA0YWN9fXsyYX0k\">The quadratic formula is: <custom-element-v2 fve-data-id=\"85f9c97e1663f93a646fe1a475e31b0fcae96844ecdd33e1bb86a609c96038ea\" fve-mdx-b64=\"JHggPSBcZnJhY3stYiBccG0gXHNxcnR7Yl4yIC0gNGFjfX17MmF9JA==\"></custom-element-v2></p>\n<h3 fve-data-id=\"ddb34abd7cd4412207e45b51b666b8be24844fe25647b6113f1034865c3acb08\" fve-mdx-b64=\"IyMjIEJsb2NrIE1hdGg=\">Block Math</h3>\n<custom-element-v2 fve-data-id=\"480486600850cac3883776106e4aa2cbf26637eb44b9e40e9b765045ebfc962b\" fve-mdx-b64=\"JCQKXGludF97LVxpbmZ0eX1ee1xpbmZ0eX0gZV57LXheMn0gZHggPSBcc3FydHtccGl9CiQk\"></custom-element-v2>\n<h3 fve-data-id=\"fde11b33c60442c37239529f054fd40eeb94ba3f7cd41d75daf5ce1aa8c72022\" fve-mdx-b64=\"IyMjIENvbXBsZXggTWF0aA==\">Complex Math</h3>\